Spoiler Follows:

Ok. To get rid of the ball and chain the most straight forward way is to read 
a scroll of remove curse. After reading, you'll see "You feel as if someone
is helping you." There are spellbooks of remove curse as well, which achieve
the same result. The difference is that spellbooks require a two step process. 
First the spell must be read, and second it must be cast. 

As for food, well the barbarian has the good fortune to start out with the
"Poison resistance" intrinsic. This means he can eat just about anything. But
be careful. If corpses hang out too long, they rot. This can be very frustratingsince rotted or "tainted" food will kill you. Incidentally, the only cure for 
tainted food that I know of is a potion of extra healing, or praying. A quaff
from a fountain may do if you're lucky, but I have never tried this.

